# C6: slowed focus dim cross-fade and tab-switch fade, captured mid-motion
# (in-app renders of the presentation layers; `capture` also asks for a
# system capture, which needs an unlocked screen).
log C6 motion polish
delivery direct
until terminal.phase attached 10000
core {"method":"layout.set","params":{"kind":"manual"}}
key ctrl+cmd+v
until tiles 2 3000
wait 2500
anim duration 1500
key alt+h
capture 01-focus-a 300
capture 01-focus-b 750
wait 1900
expect focus 1
expect dimmed 2
capture 01-focus-c 0
wait 300
key cmd+shift+t
until tabs 2 3000
wait 2500
key ctrl+1
capture 02-tab-a 150
capture 02-tab-b 500
capture 02-tab-c 900
wait 1900
capture 02-tab-d 0
wait 300
anim stats motion-stats
